From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mt_wifi7: include OSAL PMKSA API declarations

The PMKSA handler uses the structure and command IDs exported by the OSAL
cfg80211 header. Keep CFG80211_SUPPORT local to that header so this declaration
does not enable the legacy cfg80211 implementation across the whole driver.

diff --git a/mt_wifi/sta/sta_cfg.c b/mt_wifi/sta/sta_cfg.c
--- a/mt_wifi/sta/sta_cfg.c
+++ b/mt_wifi/sta/sta_cfg.c
@@ -28,0 +29,11 @@
+#ifdef MT_WIFI_OSAL_SUPPORT
+#ifndef CFG80211_SUPPORT
+#define MT_WIFI7_UNDEF_CFG80211_SUPPORT
+#define CFG80211_SUPPORT
+#endif
+#include <mt_osal_cfg80211.h>
+#ifdef MT_WIFI7_UNDEF_CFG80211_SUPPORT
+#undef CFG80211_SUPPORT
+#undef MT_WIFI7_UNDEF_CFG80211_SUPPORT
+#endif
+#endif
